      "widgets_values": [
        "GK T2VA Prompt Validator\n\nPaste or wire a prompt into 't2va_text'. The node checks the three required\nT2VA fields (order, [Shot 1] header, balanced <d> tags, increasing cut\ntimestamps) and returns is_valid + issues + a normalized copy.\n\nDialogue rule: one continuous spoken line must be a SINGLE <d>[Language] ...</d>\nblock ending in . ? or !. Splitting a line across <d> blocks is allowed only\nacross a cut (<scenetrans>) or at the clip end (<cutoff>). To see the warning,\nedit the sample so a <d> block ends mid-sentence without a marker, e.g. change\n'<d>[English] First batch of the morning.</d>' to\n'<d>[English] First batch of the</d> ... <d>[English] morning.</d>'."
      ],
      "title": "README"
    },
